<title>UK: Enviros buys UK environmental consultancy.</title>
<headline>Enviros buys UK environmental consultancy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK environmental company Enviros Ltd said on Monday that it has bought Aspinwall &amp; Co, an environmental consultancy, for 7.5 million stg.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the purchase is being funded through Enviros shares and cash.</p>
<p>Enviros was founded in November 1995 by Chris Evans and has a turnover of nearly 20 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
